  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  Title: Gingerbread Men
  TextTuto: 'If you shoot a Gingerbread Man two times, he will get frozen ! if you
    freeze all the enemies of the round, you will get the possibility to chose one
    of two bonuses before starting a new round !


    The goal of the game is to
    reach as much rounds as possible ! You can also check your records on the Learderboard
    in the main menu !'
  PanelTuto: {fileID: 272400631}
