  m_text: 'Welcome to SweetStorm !


    In this tutorial, you will see all the basics
    of the game, such as how to move :

    [ZQSD] - Move Around

    [Shift] (Hold)
    - Sprint

    [Mouse] - Look Around


    Reach the end of the corridor ! Once
    the tutorial is done, ou will automatically hop on the game !'
